OL,3,GNEWSABonfire causes large outdoor fire
OL,4,Ain dry field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warning has been issued to not be
OL,7,F"led into a false sense of security"
OL,8,Fafter a bonfire caused a large outdoor
OL,9,Ffire.
OL,11,FJersey Fire Service said it received
OL,12,Fmultiple calls just before 17:00 BST on
OL,13,FMonday to the incident near a path
OL,14,Fleading to Jersey Water's desalination
OL,15,Fplant in Corbiere.
OL,17,FThe service said 18 firefighters were
OL,18,Fdispatched to the fire, which had
OL,19,Fspread from a bonfire in a neighbouring
OL,20,Ffield of dry vegetation and was then
OL,21,Fdriven by strong winds.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
